# 👟 Nike Product Page

An interactive UI/UX design concept for a Nike shoe product page, featuring clickable product variations and smooth transition animations for an engaging shopping experience.

## Design Tool

- Figma

## Key Features

- Interactive product image showcase
- Click-to-change product variations
- Smooth transition animations
- Product information
- Size selection
- Add to Bag
- Favorite option
- Clean and minimal product layout

